  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop pea pods. Finely chop garlic. Cut firm tofu into 1cm chunks.\n• In a medium bowl, combine sweet soy seasoning, the plain flour and a good pinch of salt. Add tofu, tossing to coat.\n• In a small bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce and the low sodium soy sauce.\n• In a large microwave-safe bowl, combine garlic and a drizzle of olive oil. Microwave in 10 second bursts, until fragrant.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/687098e45a587f17f458428f/step-c11a7600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a generous drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, cook tofu, tossing occasionally, until golden, 5-7 minutes.\n• Remove from heat, then add sweet chilli-soy mixture, tossing tofu to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/687098e45a587f17f458428f/step-b6aec710.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, to bowl with garlic oil, add garlic aioli, sesame dressing and sriracha, stirring to combine.\n• Add pea pods, shredded cabbage mix and mixed salad leaves, tossing to coat. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/687098e45a587f17f458428f/step-5ab53c20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide slaw between bowls. Top with sweet soy tofu bites. Sprinkle with crushed peanuts to serve. Tear over coriander Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/687098e45a587f17f458428f/step-e0cd6130.jpg"
    }
  ]
